WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hermits.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.210
They're a sort of meditators.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.400
And they are really powerful.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.380
Fearless warriors.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.470
They said that they are the embodiment of wisdom of this world.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.350
Those who want to become almighty are called Shushi.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.180
And those,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:26.100
are divited into different styles and different powers.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.820
Reiken Mountain, which is placed in the middle of Soutenshu.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:36.780
Those who study there, are part of Reikenha.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.800
And also Ouriku is part, too.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.750
Who he might feel the Reiki sky even from the earth, too.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:49.710
And his Fuuerikon is one of the best from Reikon world.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:51.810
Therefore.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.810
After two years.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:01:03.060
He completed his apprenticeship and went into another journey of wisdom, along with other disciples.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.050
A little more...

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.060
Two mountains and we arrive home, yet.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:15.110
Daimeikoku Okukason

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:21.740
Their training is to stay along with common people,

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:27.740
and this will stimulate their growth.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:30.750
Why...

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.750
My village is so gook and dark...

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.460
Fuuerikon's Ouriku,

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:41.970
can feel the changes which took place
in the land of Reiki and the sky.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.010
Excuse me.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.270
Excuse me...

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.760
Hey, wait!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.760
Here!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.030
You're so fast...

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.440
Oh! Riku Nii-chan!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.080
Hello!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.080
You returned, yet?!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.680
Hey, are you ok?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.460
Rin-chan!

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.000
Oh, my..

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.250
Don't move.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:24.050
I'd always told you that you should be a more quiet girl.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:26.050
Where does it hurt?

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:26.890
There!

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:30.560
And done, doesn't hurt anymore, does it?

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.560
You are Riku-chan, don't you?

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.270
Yes!

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:36.830
How much will you stay?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:37.900
I haven't decide, yet...

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.990
You better don't stay too much.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.950
Shui-sensei always help us with his water.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.370
It said that water can eliminate the pain.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.600
You are, Otsuki's son?

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.150
Leader!
I'm happy to see you!

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.110
Are you ok?

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.690
Well, we try to move on with this.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.030
I'm happy to hear that.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.030
But, something is strange...

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.130
everyone act weird.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.130
Come at my home.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.800
It already passed two years?

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.590
You grew bigger.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.790
I'm still growing.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.220
You passed throw a lot, don't you?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.890
I'm sorry to remaind you this.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.810
Still, isn't your fault...

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.320
A lot happened in this village, in this two years.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:06.610
The Reiki is very polluted.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.780
It's like, some demons
are disturbed by something...

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.780
Don't say anything!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.830
If the almighty hermit will hear that, you'll be in trouble...

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.750
Almighty?

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.500
A hermit exist here?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:21.630
That's right...

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.800
Since the Mappou Age...

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:28.510
nobody had seen a hermit...

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:34.390
You have been away for a while, so you don't know.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:40.230
The world has changed. Now, even those without Reikon can became hermits.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:41.940
Who said this?

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:43.480
Shu-sensei.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.190
He is from Chishi's school.

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:49.740
He is the one who bring that hermit.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.030
Chishi?

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.870
But still...

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.750
Soon even more  will come in our village,

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:02.830
and he will make them hermits, too.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.250
He will make them hermits?

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:08.340
In this two years, many people
were blessed by them.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.720
Remember?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.760
Remember you friend, Kotora-kun...

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.470
His gift was recognize by the almighty hermit.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:18.770
Kotora?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.770
He had this kind of gift?

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.310
There are others?

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.400
Of course, Daifuku-san,

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:28.000
Tecchu, Rookun, Sayaku.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.000
I believe there are 7 or 8...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.000
They are all some boys over flowers...

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.910
Everything because of that divine water...

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:35.780
Divine water...?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.660
If you will take it for 45 days,

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.660
Reikon will be set in your body.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.420
But this won't help in regard of wounds...

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:47.800
You say that...

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.420
But still...

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.420
Jinsou Reikon is very strong.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.680
A normal school can't have something like this.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.890
And how do I get this water?

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.810
You'll get the water, if you gave them a reward.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:01.980
A reward?

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.650
Your father have some problems...

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.070
If they saw you...

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.570
I already said this.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.860
A reward.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:16.780
We have to receive a reward in
order to continue this.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.910
Don't tell me, you don't have money?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.580
No, isn't that...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:24.580
Bu still...

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.880
What exactly?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.050
Money can't be compared,

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:32.550
with the chance of being a hermit.

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.750
You're right...

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.680
100.000 coins is a big amount of money.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.640
Plus, I can't get this amount of money.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.230
I saved as much as I could.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.810
The honor of pleasing a hermit,

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.690
isn't something that everyone can do.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.190
That's right! This is the honor of our village!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.900
This is not just a simple problem,

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.410
this will affect the whole village.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.620
If you will let hermits in the village,

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.750
the whole village will be rewarded.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.920
Even Wan-chan, was able to get the Reikon...

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.210
Everything was thanks to the hermits.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.960
Ofuki Sir, please accept just this time?

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:18.640
Will you gave up on your selfishness,
for the sake of the welfare of this village?

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.180
- Really...
- I can't believed it...

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:24.850
We should do this, we have a lot of money and...

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.980
Even I could give money...

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.900
Why you don't want to think at the others?

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.320
Hold a second!

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.110
You are...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:40.120
I didn't think that ”the scams cult”,
will appear even in our village.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.870
Riku, you're back!

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.580
Oh, so you are the one...

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.330
You climbed the Reiken Mountain, two years ago.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.340
Yes! I'm the genius disciple

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:52.460
Ouriku-sama!

00:09:54.960 --> 00:10:00.890
Anyway, if you don't have any proof,
you should say nothing.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:04.310
That's right Riku-chan, apologize to them.

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:06.310
If you try to insult us.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:09.480
The great hermit will bring suffer on...

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.610
Shut up!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.900
If you try to fool us, I'll kill you!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.700
Everything you said there are just lies.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.080
What do you want to say?

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:26.700
You just sell them the hope that they could became a hermit.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:29.500
If it had been like you said,
the world would be full of hermits.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:37.130
You talk about what happened
before us, in Chishi school.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:42.010
Jinsou reikon was the creation of our masteri Rikuwa.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.350
That has nothing to do with you.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:49.480
Rikuwa shochu is part of our school.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:50.520
What?

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:52.150
You don't know that?

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.360
It seems like you're the one who has no idea what he talks.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.280
Then why are you paid?

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.280
It's a reward.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:06.740
If you desire something that much,
you have to pay for it.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.330
Do you really thing that what you do is right?

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:14.230
People with the gift are a treasure,
it doesn't matter who they are.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.550
That's why, the great Shusenkai do everything he could to find them.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.720
For you 100.000 coins it's a small amount of money,

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.510
but for those like us it's an overwhelming amount.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.270
And you want this amount for a divine water...

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.680
However it is, it's unfair.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.730
This depends on each person opinion.

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.230
People are easy to handle.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:40.150
Even if you give them what they want,
sooner or faster they will realise.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.950
Will you be pleased with this?!

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.530
Well...

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.830
If what you want is to make everyone a hermit.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.290
Then you shouldn't give the holy water taking nothing in exchange?!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.000
This is true...

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.130
Is not possible, he really is a true disciple?!

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:03.970
I'll take care of him, before he makes me trouble.

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:08.430
Riku!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.100
This is a divine punishment!

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.650
His neck is full of...

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.240
He eat it?!

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.580
This was weaker than Aya-chan's food.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.330
That needle was made at Tokomucho's school...

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.500
That weapon can penetrate even steal walls.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.210
And in peak contain poison!

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:38.630
He's a demon...

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:40.920
Demon...?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.300
He is a demon!

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:47.050
He is not human! He is a demon
let on earth by the devil!

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:51.350
- A demon...
- The cute Riku-chan?

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.940
This is why he is so arrogant?

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.940
Always he was so weird...

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.150
You came here to...

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:03.150
It seems like I have to kill you.

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:15.790
Riku!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.040
Die!

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:19.290
Wait!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:29.890
Two years passed...

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.810
Hey Kotora, in those two years you became bigger.

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:50.810
Ouriku...

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.810
You can still turn back...

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.000
Even though you chose the wrong path...

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.000
We are childhood friends.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:59.460
I'll forgive you.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.040
If you'll make more trouble...

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.040
Kotora...

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.930
I always though you are an idiot...

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.930
Now you're a big idiot...

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:11.930
You...

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.600
You really don't understand?

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:19.020
You spend a long period of time at Chishi's school?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.400
Then you know what kind of people are they, don't you?

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.900
It's meditation time...

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.370
Chishi's school...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.950
Chishi's school...

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:38.410
Chishi's school?

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.710
Is the most decent school!

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.710
Chishi's school...

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:49.550
It's a school where you can talk to
the others hermits. It's a school of hope!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:53.390
Thanks to them I became stronger.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.060
They changed my destiny!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.480
From a common person I became a disciple!

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:08.690
Chishi's school will help each of you, you'll be like me, you'll find your own path!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.410
He is right!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.570
We can also do it!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:17.000
If we'll do as the hermit say, everything will be alright.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:17.950
What a relief!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:22.250
In all this time we didn't see each other,
you became more pathetic.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.880
Well then, let's finish this.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:31.880
Stop!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.220
Idiot! You wanna kill your friend?!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.560
I don't know what happened to you in those two years...

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.690
But, in this moment, what is the differents between you and a demon?!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:44.490
Move!

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.610
Hey, wait!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:50.150
What's wrong with this stupid, too?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:50.990
You're right...

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:54.030
I always though he has something at his head.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.240
- You crazy!
- Leave this town!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.240
What reckless people...

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:04.790
They still believe that everything is real ..

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:08.790
I'm home.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:09.710
Riku!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:10.920
You're Riku, don't you?

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.920
Yes, I'm back.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.330
My ear still hurts...

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.820
It's because you misbehaved.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:18.930
But still...

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:21.730
I'm glad that Riku-chan is back.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.580
I hear nothing of you, since you left the village.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.580
I was very worried.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:28.310
I sent many letters.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:29.610
I receive nothing.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:30.690
Strange...

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:35.360
Those who want to became hermits
must cut their bonds with their relatives.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.160
I don't think this is the cause.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.910
Shou-chan isn't with you?

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.870
The child who was always with you?

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:44.990
I also said this in the letter.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.790
They really sent nothing?

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.590
We receive nothing this two years...

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.420
Absolutely nothing...

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.000
Maybe is the fault of Chishi's?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:56.800
But...

00:16:56.800 --> 00:17:00.350
I didn't think that Riku-chan will became a hermit...

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.350
Riku.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.350
Now that we are here you can tell us,

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.230
what happened in your journey?

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.610
Yes, of course...

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.270
I will begun with the selection ceremony...

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:11.980
Then...

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:14.900
Open the door!

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.280
If you don't, we will break it!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:18.620
I'm coming right now...

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.120
Riku, I'll try to talk with them.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.080
I won't touch those from the village.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:25.750
But still...

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.750
Sometimes it has to be shed some blood...

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.340
Riku!

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.000
It won't hold too much.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:40.930
The demon...

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:41.810
It's really he...

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:45.140
He is a demon!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.940
Like the hermit said!

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.310
We can't fight him!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:52.230
We can't do it, we'll die!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:54.230
Coward!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.030
The hermits are behind us!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:03.290
Did you know that the two or three ranked hermits,
are the weakest fighters?

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.710
If he accept that he was wrong, we will forgive him.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.710
Kill the demon!

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.140
It's seems like he won't do it.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.140
What amazing moves!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.140
Amazing!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.060
What we'll do?

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:35.650
If you want to put an end on the doubts, you have to kill them.

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:36.530
Very well!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:45.750
It can't be...!

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:54.840
Come...

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.990
Hiya Shoushinshu!

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:33.540
Those butterflies were made from my blood.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.800
If you hurt me, this blood will spread everywhere.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:42.090
And it will kill everyone from the village.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:43.970
No way!

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:45.970
The Vanish!

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:52.560
So stupid...

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:04.860
He eat them?

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:14.420
Before I came here, I took part on a
very good training.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:21.170
Your move can't be compared with that training.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:25.000
Die, you delinquint!

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:33.100
Go back to Chishi's school and tell them

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:40.190
that a succesor disciple of Reikenhan, Ouriku is here and he doesn't want you to put your hands on this village anymore.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:50.620
It can't be...

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.540
It's impossible that one of the Reikenha,
to be here in a village like this.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.830
We will retreat?

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:58.420
No, we can't give up now.

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:04.420
So this is the place...

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:14.640
Where that piece of meteorite fell...

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.480
Dad say that it is burried here.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:23.400
To think of it now,
he protect me in this whole time...

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:34.330
Demon...

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.960
Everyone is foolled...

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:45.600
But still isn't just that.
Everyone have their heart dirty.

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:51.890
I'm a disciple. I can't fight
the people from the village.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:55.890
You told me that coming back home was a part of your training.

00:21:57.390 --> 00:22:02.270
Maybe your seniors sent you here to clear their minds.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:08.410
If it's like this, then this village
is a part of your training.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:11.660
Maybe this is it...

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:47.590
Next time!

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:49.130
The fight begin!
